{"title":"Career Roadmap · Biotech Executive","role":"Biotech Executive","summary":"A Biotech Executive is a broad industry-facing role that supports biotechnology products, operations, laboratory activities, quality processes, business development, technical sales, regulatory coordination, production or research activities.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science - General / Honours)","Course":"Biotechnology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Biotech Executive is a broad industry-facing role that supports biotechnology products, operations, laboratory activities, quality processes, business development, technical sales, regulatory coordination, production or research activities."},{"type":"p","text":"The exact responsibilities vary significantly by employer. Depending on the organization, a Biotech Executive may work in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biotechnology operations"},{"text":"Laboratory coordination"},{"text":"Production and bioprocessing"},{"text":"Quality control"},{"text":"Quality assurance"},{"text":"Technical sales"},{"text":"Business development"},{"text":"Product support"},{"text":"Clinical/diagnostic operations"},{"text":"Regulatory coordination"},{"text":"Research and development"},{"text":"Documentation and compliance"},{"text":"Scientific customer support"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Because the title is broad, the student should build a core biotechnology foundation + one clear industry specialization rather than preparing generically for every biotech function."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Biotechnology","Laboratory Skills","Quality & Documentation","Data Analysis","Industry Operations","Communication","One Technical Specialization"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Career Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Biotechnology","Biology + Chemistry + Biochemistry","Molecular