les appropriately"},{"text":"Understand fermentation and bioprocessing"},{"text":"Understand basic QC/QA concepts"},{"text":"Prepare and follow SOP-based workflows"},{"text":"Maintain accurate technical documentation"},{"text":"Analyze basic scientific and operational data"},{"text":"Use Excel confidently"},{"text":"Create basic Power BI dashboards"},{"text":"Understand biotechnology products and markets"},{"text":"Present scientific information professionally"},{"text":"Communicate with technical and non-technical stakeholders"},{"text":"Read scientific literature"},{"text":"Complete an industry-relevant internship"},{"text":"Demonstrate one clear specialization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"Because Biotech Executive is a broad job title, the student should avoid graduating with only general biotechnology knowledge."},{"type":"p","text":"A stronger profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Biotechnology","Core Laboratory Skills","Quality & Documentation","Bioprocess/Research Knowledge","Data Skills","Communication","One Industry Specialization"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should then choose one of the major directions:"},{"type":"p","text":"R&D | Quality | Production | Diagnostics | Regulatory | Technical Sales | Business Development"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Career Pathways"},{"type":"table","header":["Pathway","Core Focus","Long-Term Direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"R&D"},{"text":"Molecular biology + research"},{"text":"Research Specialist"}],[{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"QC + QA + compliance"},{"text":"Quality Manager"}],[{"text":"Production"},{"text":"Bioprocess + manufacturing"},{"text":"Production Manager"}],[{"text":"Diagnostics"},{"text":"Molecular testing + QC"},{"text":"Diagnostic Specialist"}],[{"text":"Regulatory"},{"text":"Documentation + compliance"},{"text":"Regulatory Manager"}],[{"text":"Technical Sales"},{"text":"Scientific products + sales"},{"text":"Product / Sales Manager"}],[{"text